  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/925004074192085042/935849247268548688/hedgehog_logo.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/852113429983395870/935050833719078982/2022-01-24_13.56.22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"581\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/925004074192085042/935853742778114058/kiwi_banner.png\" width=\"1167\" height=\"29\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/jnvJxtK8AK\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/740028725654978610?color=9cb4b2&amp;label= &amp;labelColor=5d7170&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord\" width=\"147\" height=\"30\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/OrcinusWasTaken\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/OrcinusWasTaken?label=&amp;color=9cb4b2&amp;labelColor=5d7170&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"87\" height=\"30\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/orcinuslounge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Patreon-Orcinus?label=&amp;color=9cb4b2&amp;labelColor=5d7170&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Patreon&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"126\" height=\"30\"></strong></span></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fOrcinus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/965279556036599909/1050609609074806814/bisect_partnership.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"188\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/orcinuslounge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Fabric版本：&nbsp;</strong></span></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hedgehogs-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hedgehogs-fabric</strong></span></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/jnvJxtK8AK\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><br><br> </strong></span></a></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>奇異果：</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\">- 奇異果可從流浪商人處獲得</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\">- 奇異果可食用或種植。種植後可收穫更多奇異果</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\">- 刺蝟會因奇異果而親近你</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>刺蝟：</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\">- 刺蝟是可馴服的新生物</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\">- 當生命值較低時若餵食奇異果，牠們會攻擊除苦力怕外的所有生物</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\">- 生成於草原生態域</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\">- 可使用奇異果或蘋果馴服</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\">- 會攻擊蜘蛛並食用蜘蛛眼</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\">- 看到附近放置的頭顱或生物手持牛奶桶時會受驚</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\">- 將其命名為「SpeedBoy」可獲得藍色變種</p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>新機制： </strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\">- 當刺蝟啃食蜘蛛眼後會進入「塗藥狀態」。此時可對其使用藥水，使其成為藥水載體。附著藥水效果會依原藥水時長持續，瞬間型藥水會在玩家觸碰刺蝟時立即生效。需注意：僅當刺蝟處於「蜷縮防禦狀態」時才會傳遞藥水效果。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/925004074192085042/935853742778114058/kiwi_banner.png\" width=\"1167\" height=\"29\"></p>",
